WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.001
Play your own videos with FrameIsle.
No account or included movies.

00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:21.448
Add Local Folder and authorize it
using the system file picker.

00:00:21.448 --> 00:00:38.363
Import a trusted QR configuration to add your NAS.
This demo uses a local test account.

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:49.283
SMB discovers shared folders automatically.
Choose a share to browse its videos.

00:00:49.283 --> 00:00:56.260
Open a video to start playback.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:03.256
Drag the timeline to find your place.

00:01:03.256 --> 00:01:19.092
Enter full screen, then use the exit button
to return to the player.

00:01:19.092 --> 00:01:29.767
Tap the star to save this folder.
Open it again from Favorite Folders.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:39.661
Open the video menu and choose Cache Locally.
Keep the app open until the download finishes.

00:01:39.661 --> 00:01:50.451
Play the completed local copy from Local Cache.

00:01:50.451 --> 00:02:02.096
Delete the cached copy when you no longer need it.
The original NAS file is kept.

00:02:02.096 --> 00:02:13.038
Share the connection as a QR code.
Passwords are excluded by default.

00:02:13.038 --> 00:02:33.807
Import a QR image and review it before saving.
Enter the password separately on the other device.

00:02:33.807 --> 00:02:36.811
More help: Settings → Getting Started.
